# Build requirements for the Go CLI wheels, shared by cli, tools/ods and
# tools/ods-audit. Must stay identical to `[build-system] requires` in all three
# pyproject.toml files; the build-constraints-drift pre-commit hook enforces that.
#
# Compiled into build-constraints.txt, which the release workflows pass as
# UV_BUILD_CONSTRAINT with UV_REQUIRE_HASHES so every wheel builds against the
# same verified closure.
